{
  "summary": "In LibreOffice Impress, slide shows display presentations on full screens or projectors and cannot be edited during the show. Users can start a slide show using the F5 function key and navigate through slides using keyboard arrow keys, the space bar, or the right-click context menu. Pressing the Escape key or choosing End Show from the context menu exits the presentation. By enabling the mouse pointer visible and mouse pointer as pen options within the Slide Show Settings dialog box, presenters can draw or write directly on slides during a presentation. Slide transitions are visual effects applied when moving from one slide to another. Within the Slide Sorter tab, users can view all slides and easily rearrange their order by dragging and dropping them. Individual slides can have custom transition effects, such as Wipe Up, applied from the Slide Transition section in the Task Pane. Additionally, transition speed can be adjusted to options like medium, and transition sounds can be configured.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact": "Presentations cannot be edited while in slide show mode.",
      "evidence": "प्रस्तुतियाँ slide show mode में संपादित नहीं की जा सकती हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The F5 function key can be used to start a slide show.",
      "evidence": "slide show को शुरू करने के लिए function की f5 को उपयोग कर सकते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Pressing the escape button exits the slide show.",
      "evidence": "बाहर आने के लिए दूसरा तरीका है escape button दबाएँ"
    },
    {
      "fact": "The mouse pointer as pen option allows users to draw and write on the presentation during slide show mode.",
      "evidence": "यह option आपको प्रस्तुति पर लिखने और कुछ बनाने की अनुमति देता है जब यह slide show mode में हो"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Pressing the space bar advances the presentation to the next slide.",
      "evidence": "आप अगली slide को आगे बढ़ा सकते हैं जब आप space bar दबाते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Slide transitions are visual effects applied when moving from one slide to another in a presentation.",
      "evidence": "ट्रांजिशनस्स प्रभाव हैं जो slides पर लागू किये जाते हैं जब हम प्रस्तुति में एक slides से दूसरी slides पर स्थानांतरण या transitions करते हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Clicking on the Slide Sorter tab displays all slides in the presentation.",
      "evidence": "slide sorter टैब पर click करें प्रस्तुति की सभी slides यहाँ प्रदर्शित होती हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Slides can be rearranged by dragging and dropping a selected slide to a new position.",
      "evidence": "slides 3 और 4 के बीच slide को drag और drop करें slides पुनः व्यवस्थित हो गयी हैं"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Transitions can be applied to slides by selecting slide transitions in the task pane.",
      "evidence": "task pane में slide transitions पर click करें"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Transition speed can be adjusted by selecting an option from the speed dropdown menu.",
      "evidence": "आप speed dropdown menu से options का चुनाव करके transition की गति नियंत्रित कर सकते हैं"
    }
  ]
}
